@base = http://localhost:8080

### Collection: 200
GET {{base}}/api/books

### Existing item: 200
GET {{base}}/api/books/1

### Missing item: 404 application/problem+json
GET {{base}}/api/books/999

### Create: 201 + Location
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "REST API Design",
  "author": "Demo Author",
  "year": 2026,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### Replace: 200
PUT {{base}}/api/books/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "REST API Design Second Edition",
  "author": "Demo Author",
  "year": 2026,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### Delete: 204, and 404 on the second request
DELETE {{base}}/api/books/4

### Invalid request: 400 application/problem+json
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Demo Author",
  "year": 2026,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### Duplicate title and author: 409 application/problem+json
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### Variant 12: valid search
GET {{base}}/api/books/search?q=Java

### Variant 12: invalid search
GET {{base}}/api/books/search?q=a

### OpenAPI document
GET {{base}}/v3/api-docs
